      "section_path": [
        "Full-Time Employment Contract C",
        "Appointment and normal hours"
      ],
      "text": "The Employee will perform administrative service work in the Operations team and report to the assigned team manager. Contracted working time is 40 hours/week, normally Monday through Friday, eight scheduled hours each day, excluding unpaid breaks. PeopleFlow's assigned workplace timezone determines attendance and roster boundaries. A different roster requires manager confirmation and must preserve the weekly total unless separately approved overtime applies.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "heading_level": 2,
      "is_semantic": true,
      "list_level": null,
      "location": {
