      "section_path": [
        "Full-Time Employment Contract C",
        "Contract C benefits"
      ],
      "text": "These are the agreed contractual amounts and must not be reduced again for part-time status. Only scheduled missed workdays consume the leave allowances. Up to five unused annual leave days may carry over with approval by 15 December, expiring on 31 March. The first three consecutive scheduled sick workdays may be self-certified; medical evidence is required from the fourth. Administration follows the Annual Leave Policy and Sick Pay & Absence Policy.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
