      "section_path": [
        "Full-Time Employment Contract C",
        "Overtime and time off in lieu"
      ],
      "text": "Prior manager approval is required. Eligible actual work above 40 hours in a week may earn cash at 1.5 times the contract hourly base or TOIL at 1.5 hours per eligible hour. Overtime is limited to 8 hours per week and total work to 48 hours. The Overtime & TOIL Policy governs the calculation and use of credits.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
