      "section_path": [
        "Full-Time Employment Contract C",
        "Probation and amendments"
      ],
      "text": "Probation lasts three calendar months without reducing the stated benefits. Variations require HR approval, an effective date and a new signed package. The previous agreement remains in history. A roster change or profile update cannot vary these terms.",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
